    {
      "subId": "46513",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Huffman about the Knights' situation",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "4650501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "4650501": {
            "id": "4650501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "If we do not make contact with the Darknight Hero soon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650502"
            ]
          },
          "4650502": {
            "id": "4650502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What are we to do about the Abyss Order's challenge?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650503"
            ]
          },
          "4650503": {
            "id": "4650503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Ah, it's you two. I must admit, this issue of the Darknight Hero is proving to be something of a headache.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650504"
            ]
          },
          "4650504": {
            "id": "4650504",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "We've just held a meeting to decide on an appropriate course of action. Can you guess what it is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650506",
              "4650509"
            ]
          },
          "4650506": {
            "id": "4650506",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Haha... Good one. But no, the Knights cannot afford to simply stand by and watch while there is even the slightest inkling of a threat facing Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650507"
            ]
          },
          "4650507": {
            "id": "4650507",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "If that were the case, more and more people would start to rely on the Darknight Hero instead of the Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650511"
            ]
          },
          "4650511": {
            "id": "4650511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh. Well, what's the plan then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650512"
            ]
          },
          "4650512": {
            "id": "4650512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Find out the Darknight Hero's true identity, and offer him our protection.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650513"
            ]
          },
          "4650513": {
            "id": "4650513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Protection\"? He seems to be doing just fine without your protection so far, y'know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650514"
            ]
          },
          "4650514": {
            "id": "4650514",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Pff...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650515"
            ]
          },
          "4650515": {
            "id": "4650515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Well, since you've aided the Knights in the past, I might as well just tell you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650516"
            ]
          },
          "4650516": {
            "id": "4650516",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "The offer of protection is just a ruse, in order for the Knights of Favonius to take over full — and exclusive — responsibility for this matter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650517"
            ]
          },
          "4650517": {
            "id": "4650517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You aren't gonna let the Darknight Hero be all heroic and stuff? Why not?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650518"
            ]
          },
          "4650518": {
            "id": "4650518",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Firstly, to show the might of the Knights of Favonius — to prove to the people that without the Darknight Hero, they can still rely on the Knights to maintain peace and harmony.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650519"
            ]
          },
          "4650519": {
            "id": "4650519",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Secondly, the Abyss Order have no mercy in their hearts. If anything happened to the Darknight Hero...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650520"
            ]
          },
          "4650520": {
            "id": "4650520",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "It would only serve to further their nefarious ambitions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650521"
            ]
          },
          "4650521": {
            "id": "4650521",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Gosh... Paimon never knew the life of a knight involved so much untold anguish before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650522"
            ]
          },
          "4650522": {
            "id": "4650522",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "But none of this will work if we don't establish the Darknight Hero's true identity in time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650523"
            ]
          },
          "4650523": {
            "id": "4650523",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "There's no need to despair, Huffman. Just follow my plan and everything will be fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650524"
            ]
          },
          "4650524": {
            "id": "4650524",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Ah, Captain Kaeya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650525"
            ]
          },
          "4650525": {
            "id": "4650525",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Lately, Master Diluc has been working the bar at the Angel's Share every night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650526"
            ]
          },
          "4650526": {
            "id": "4650526",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "All I need you to do is keep him in your sight. Think you can manage that for me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650527"
            ]
          },
          "4650527": {
            "id": "4650527",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Yes, Captain Kaeya! ...But, does that mean that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650528"
            ]
          },
          "4650528": {
            "id": "4650528",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Master Diluc is the Darknight Hero?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650529"
            ]
          },
          "4650529": {
            "id": "4650529",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Kaeya",
            "text": "Who knows...? It's just a hunch. I've been known to be wrong on occasion."
          },
          "4650509": {
            "id": "4650509",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "No. That would send a signal that the Knights are in favor of the Darknight Hero's continued presence in our city... which we are not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "4650510"
            ]
          },
          "4650510": {
            "id": "4650510",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Huffman",
            "text": "Encouraging this kind of individual heroism undermines the Knights' authority."
          }
        }
      }
    },
